    "answer": {
      "short": "D",
      "worked": "For option D,\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{blue}) &= \\frac{\\text{number of blue marbles}}{\\text{total number of marbles}} \\\\ P(\\text{blue}) &= \\frac{6}{6+5+5} \\\\ P(\\text{blue}) &= \\frac{6}{16} \\\\ P(\\text{blue}) &= \\frac{3}{8}.\\end{align*}$$\nCorrect answer: D.",
